               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In Europe: Adding with Calculi\n\nThe *calculi* organize counting by place value. Adding on the *calculi* means placing the total in the correct columns: a marker below the bar is worth 1 and a marker above the bar is worth 5.\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and follow the steps: start by writing the first number, then add the second number and carry 1 to the tens column. Remember that the units are on the right and the tens to their left.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "a8f3c1d2-5b64-4e17-9c2a-1d0f3b6e8a0a",
