               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In Asia (India): Adding with Hindu-Arabic Numerals\n\nThe Hindu-Arabic numerals let us write the result of an addition with only ten symbols. When a sum reaches ten, the carry moves to the next place and the digit that stays is written in the current place.\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and write the result in the vertical addition. Type the digit that stays in the units column in the result row, and type 1 in the carry box above the tens column.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
