         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### In Asia (China): Adding with the Suanpan\n\nOn the suanpan, each column represents a place value. To add, move the beads until the columns show the total, carrying one bead to the next column when a column reaches ten.\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and move the beads: start by writing the first number, then add the second number and carry 1 to the tens column. The suanpan has two beads above the bar and five below it in each column.",
               "source": null,
