               "text": "#### In Asia (Japan): Adding with the Soroban\n\nThe soroban reached Japan from China and follows the same idea: each column is a place value, and the beads represent the digits of the result.\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and move the beads: start by writing the first number, then add the second number and carry 1 to the tens column. The soroban has one bead above the bar and four below it in each column.",
