               "text": "#### In Russia: Adding with the Schyoty\n\nThe schyoty is a vertical abacus in which each row is a place value. To add, move the beads until the rows show the total.\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and move the beads: start by writing the first number, then add the second number and carry 1 to the tens row. The schyoty is vertical: each row is a place value and the beads slide horizontally along the wires.",
